2026-07-27T08:20:42.5708861Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:20:42.5775019Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:20:42.5775522Z i /tmp/RtmpXhXhms/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:20:42.5775856Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:20:42.5776249Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:20:42.5776858Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:20:42.5777394Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:20:42.5778509Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:20:42.5779114Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:20:42.6042881Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:42.6154756Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:42.6602567Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:42.6769743Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
